{"id":69618,"date":"2025-09-24T07:34:59","date_gmt":"2025-09-24T06:34:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69618"},"modified":"2026-10-15T10:08:27","modified_gmt":"2026-10-15T09:08:27","slug":"corrida-de-sao-martinho-adriano-valente","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-de-sao-martinho-adriano-valente\/","title":{"rendered":"11\u00aa Corrida de S\u00e3o Martinho \u2013 Adriano Valente 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">11\u00aa Corrida de S\u00e3o Martinho \u2013 Adriano Valente 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>11\u00aa Corrida de S\u00e3o Martinho \u2013 Adriano Valente 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>22 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), \u00e0s <strong>10:30<\/strong>, na vila de <strong>Arco de Ba\u00falhe<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Cabeceiras de Basto<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>. Com partida e chegada na <strong>Rua do Arco de Ba\u00falhe<\/strong>, o evento integra a prova principal de <strong>Corrida de Estrada de 10 km<\/strong> (aberta a atletas federados e n\u00e3o federados nascidos em 2008 e anteriores) e uma <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de vertente l\u00fadica.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O percurso dos <strong>10 km<\/strong> desenvolve-se pelas art\u00e9rias da Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Arco de Ba\u00falhe e Vila Nune (incluindo passagem pela Avenida Capit\u00e3o El\u00edsio de Azevedo), contando com abastecimento l\u00edquido ao quil\u00f3metro 5 e na meta. A competi\u00e7\u00e3o atribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos tr\u00eas primeiros classificados masculinos e femininos de seis escal\u00f5es (Seniores at\u00e9 39 anos: 120 \u20ac, 70 \u20ac e 40 \u20ac; Veteranos 40 dos 40 aos 49 anos e Veteranos 50 para maiores de 50 anos: 80 \u20ac, 50 \u20ac e 30 \u20ac), al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us \u00e0s cinco primeiras equipas (pontuando os quatro melhores atletas de cada forma\u00e7\u00e3o).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo grupo <strong>Arco4Run<\/strong> e pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Festeiros do Arco<\/strong> (com a Caminhada dinamizada pelo Desportivo do Arco de Ba\u00falhe e apoio da Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Arco de Ba\u00falhe e Vila Nune e do Munic\u00edpio de Cabeceiras de Basto), a prova presta homenagem a Adriano Valente e integra o programa festivo das tradicionais Feiras de S\u00e3o Martinho. O secretariado para levantamento de dorsais e chips funciona no pr\u00f3prio domingo, 22 de novembro, entre as <strong>08:30 e as 10:00<\/strong>, na <strong>Casa do Povo de Arco de Ba\u00falhe<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">22 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 10:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Rua do Arco de Ba\u00falhe, Arco de Ba\u00falhe, Cabeceiras de Basto, Braga<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><st